    "https://careers.centre.edu/channels/arts-media-entertainment/": {
      "title": "Arts, Media & Entertainment",
      "description": "Arts, Media & Entertainment – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team News & Advice Career Resources Student Resources Jobs & Internships Career Videos Our Outcomes Arts, Media & Entertainment Take Your Creativity to Work This is a career field rich in opportunity. From theaters to galleries, to museums and filmsets, leaders in arts, media, and entertainment are always on the lookout for smart, talented critical thinkers. Learn more about where Centre faculty and alumni can help you make connections and explore what might be next by joining the Arts, Media, & Entertainment Career Exploration Community. Sign up for this CEC Sign up for the LinkedIn Group Sidebar Upcoming Events September Sep 04 Event: Register Here: 2026 SMBC Explore (for College Sophomores) Fri, Sep 4 from 10am - 4pm Friday, September 4th from 10am - 4pm Sep 08 Event: USPS - Automotive Technician Zoom Webinar - Memphis, TN Tue, Sep 8 from 10am - 11am Tuesday, September 8th from 10am - 11am Sep 08 Event: Lexington Police Cowan Table Tue, Sep 8 from 11:30am - 12:30pm Tuesday, September 8th from 11:30am - 12:30pm Sep 08 Event: GWI Ask Admissions: Open Q&A Session Tue, Sep 8 from 4pm - 4:45pm Tuesday, September 8th from 4pm - 4:45pm Sep 08 Event: Meet the Business - Wealth, U.S. Consumer Cards & Services (North America Session) Tue, Sep 8 from 5pm - 5:45pm Tuesday, Septembe