    "https://careers.centre.edu/channels/health-medicine/": {
      "title": "Health & Medicine",
      "description": "Health & Medicine – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team News & Advice Career Resources Student Resources Jobs & Internships Career Videos Our Outcomes Health & Medicine Apply Your Knowledge, Skill and Compassion Centre’s robust list of pre-professional programs provide a wide array of options for getting into health and medicine careers. Use the Health & Medicine Career Exploration Community to learn about what’s available and how to get there. In addition to career advice this exploration community can provide guidance on professional schools and graduate exams. It is an indispensable resource for taking the next step to become a medical professional. Sign up for this CEC Sign up for the LinkedIn Group Sidebar Upcoming Events September Sep 09 Event: Epic Careers Tech Talk: Improving Access – Adolescent Medicine Wed, Sep 9 from 1pm - 2pm Wednesday, September 9th from 1pm - 2pm Sep 09 Event: Summer Internship Showcase Wed, Sep 9 from 4pm - 5:30pm Wednesday, September 9th from 4pm - 5:30pm Sep 09 Event: Introduction to Pre-Med Wed, Sep 9 from 7:15pm - 8:15pm Wednesday, September 9th from 7:15pm - 8:15pm Sep 10 Event: Navigating the Federal Hiring Process: Assessment Process & Interview Tips Thu, Sep 10 from 2pm - 3pm Thursday, September 10th from 2pm - 3pm Sep 10 Event: Neuro Spotlight: Imaging Careers at Cleveland Clinic Thu, Sep 10 