      "title": "Law, Government & Policy",
      "description": "Law, Government & Policy – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team News & Advice Career Resources Student Resources Jobs & Internships Career Videos Our Outcomes Law, Government & Policy Put Your Critical Thinking Cap On One of the hallmarks of the world class Liberal Arts and Sciences education from Centre College is critical thinking. Law, government and public policy are fields that thrives on it. Now more than ever these institutions need fresh viewpoints and new ideas. The Law, Government & Policy Career Exploration Community will help you explore the options that can help you land with the right organization after graduation. Sign up for this CEC Sign up for the LinkedIn Group Sidebar Upcoming Events September Sep 08 Event: Lexington Police Cowan Table Tue, Sep 8 from 11:30am - 12:30pm Tuesday, September 8th from 11:30am - 12:30pm Sep 09 Event: CBP Attorney Virtual Career Expo – September 9th Wed, Sep 9 from 1pm - 4pm Wednesday, September 9th from 1pm - 4pm Sep 09 Event: Summer Internship Showcase Wed, Sep 9 from 4pm - 5:30pm Wednesday, September 9th from 4pm - 5:30pm Sep 10 Event: U.S. Customs and Border Protection DHS Virtual Career Expo 9/10 Thu, Sep 10 from 11am - 4pm Thursday, September 10th from 11am - 4pm Sep 10 Event: Pre-Law 101 Thu, Sep 10 from 11:45am - 12:30pm Thursday, September 10th from 11:45am - 12:30pm View More C