      "description": "Science, Engineering & Tech – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team News & Advice Career Resources Student Resources Jobs & Internships Career Videos Our Outcomes Science, Engineering & Tech Be on the Leading Edge of Progress The percentage varies depending on the resource, but STEM-based careers are projected to grow 10 to 15% in the next ten years. The rapid pace of global change will provide a variety of opportunities in the decades to come. A Centre STEM education will provide a strong foundation. The Science, Engineering & Tech Career Exploration Community has the resources to guide you to where you can make a difference. Sign up for this CEC Sign up for the LinkedIn Group Sidebar Upcoming Events September Sep 08 Event: USPS - Automotive Technician Zoom Webinar - Memphis, TN Tue, Sep 8 from 10am - 11am Tuesday, September 8th from 10am - 11am Sep 09 Event: Merck Manufacturing Leadership Development Program (MLDP) Info Session [Virtual] Wed, Sep 9 from 10am - 11am Wednesday, September 9th from 10am - 11am Sep 09 Event: McKenney's Career Fair Prep Workshop! Wed, Sep 9 from 10am - 10:30am Wednesday, September 9th from 10am - 10:30am Sep 09 Event: Team Leader Production Virtual Info Session Wed, Sep 9 from 1pm - 2pm Wednesday, September 9th from 1pm - 2pm Sep 09 Event: Explore Deloitte: Real Talk & Real Work Panel (Option #1) Wed, Sep