    "https://careers.centre.edu/channels/explore-your-interests-self-assessment/": {
      "title": "Explore Your Interests",
      "description": "Explore Your Interests – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team News & Advice Career Resources Student Resources Jobs & Internships Career Videos Our Outcomes Explore Your Interests Not sure what you want to do? We’re here to help you with our collection of resources organized by Career Exploration Community, including a CEC quiz to help you get started, self-assessments with a career coach (Strong Interest Inventory, MBTI), and more resources and Career Chat videos located below. Search by Area of Interest We have collected resources on each of our Career Exploration Communities pages. Click on your areas of interest below and explore the available resources and videos. Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Find the Right Fit Having trouble deciding which community is right for you? Take our CEC Quiz. Take the CEC quiz Occupational Outlook Handbook The OOH is the government’s primary career source detailing all you need to know about a huge variety of occupations and helping you research your interests. Details include the kind of work each occupation consists of, work environments, education pathways or experience requirements, average pay, and much more. Search the Occupational Outlook Handbook Sidebar Connect with Us Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Career Resources Skip filter options to posts Filter Clear Filter: Filters See More Filters Filter Controls Resource Categories: Community Resources Cover Letter/Thank You Resources Employer Resources Faculty & Staff Resources Financial Aid How-tos & Support Guides Job Search Tools Networking Tools Online Tools Professional Associations Resume Resources Student Clubs & Organizations Student Highlighted Resources Close Clear Filters Career Advocates Share This: Share Career Advocates on Facebook Share Career Advocates on LinkedIn Share Career Advocates on X Copy Link Put the power of the Centre Alumni network to work. Former students helping current students succeed is the heart of … Read More Career Explorations Quiz Share This: Share Career Explorations Quiz on Facebook Share Career Explorations Quiz on LinkedIn Share Career Explorations Quiz on X Copy Link Confused about which CEC a student should join? Take this quiz to find out! View Resource What Can I Do with This Major? Share This: Share What Can I Do with This Major? on Facebook Share What Can I Do with This Major? on LinkedIn Share What Can I Do with This Major? on X Copy Link What Can I Do With This Major? features 100 major profiles with information on common career paths, types of employers … Read More Occupational Outlook Handbook Share This: Share Occupational Outlook Handbook on Facebook Share Occupational Outlook Handbook on LinkedIn Share Occupational Outlook Handbook on X Copy Link You can use the Occupational Outlook Handbook to research all careers and employment projections. View Resource View All Resources Career Videos Mini Career Chat: Education Video post Genetics Career Chat Video post UX Design Career Chat Video post Software Engineering Employer Panel Video post Mini Career Chat: Lobbyist Video post Social Engagement Legislative Advocacy Video post View All Videos Contact & Location Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 CCPD Hours M Monday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Jess Metzmeier Meet Jess Joy Asher Meet Joy Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Nate Meissner Meet Nate Lainy Castañeda Meet Lainy Kaitlyn Overstreet Meet Kaitlyn Michael Taylor Meet Michael Laura Hill Meet Laura Genny Ballard Meet Genny Bryana Miracle Meet Bryana Sherri Gowins Meet Sherri Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Centre College"
