in School Counseling, a Master of Arts in Professional Counseling, and is a Certified Career Counselor through the National Career Development Association. Contact Phone Number 859.238.5306 Email michael.taylor@centre.edu Laura Hill Associate Director of Employer and Alumni Career Networks With over 11 years of dedicated experience in healthcare business development, Laura built a career centered on creating meaningful partnerships, expanding access to care, and championing innovative strategies that improve lives. Her journey in healthcare allowed her to strengthen community relationships, drive growth initiatives, and advocate for compassionate, high-quality behavioral healthcare. Laura Hill is excited to bring this same passion for connection, strategy, and growth into the world of higher education. As the Associate Director of Employer and Alumni Career Networks for Centre College, she will partner with employers, alumni, and community organizations to support student development and career readiness. By combining her background in business development with a heart for mentorship and collaboration, she is committed to helping students explore opportunities, build confidence, and prepare for successful futures. As a proud Centre alum, it’s especially meaningful to return to her alma mater and invest in the next generation of Colonels. She is honored to support current students as they shape their paths and help foster connections that will continue to strengthen the Centre community for years to come. Contact Phone Number 859-608-0869 Email laura.hill@centre.edu Genny Ballard Assistant Dean for Career Access and Opportunity and Professor of Spanish Genny Ballard, Ph.D. is Assistant Dean for Career Access and Opportunity and Professor of Spanish at Centre College in Kentucky. She is a Returned Peace Corps Volunteer and a U.S. Fulbright Scholar. Dr. Ballard is actively engaged in international education, community-based learning, and student internships. She has extensive study abroad experience, having directed several programs in Latin America. Ballard is also an active contributor to international research groups that focus on intercultural competence and language teaching. Contact Email genny.ballard@centre.edu Bryana Miracle Marketing & Communications Specialist Bryana Miracle joined the Center for Career & Professional Development in January 2019 as the Employer Relations Specialist, and later took on the role of Marketing & Communications Specialist in 2023. In this role, she creates and leads all marketing and outreach initiatives, oversees the CCPD website and social media accounts, and is responsible for the creation and design of promotional materials for the office. Bryana is an Eastern Kentucky University graduate with a Bachelor’s Degree in Communication Studies through the College of Letters, Arts, and Social Sciences. Contact Phone Number 859.238.5949 Email bryana.miracle@centre.edu Sherri Gowins Senior Administrative Assistant Sherri Gowins joined the Center for Career & Professional Development in 2001 as the Administrative Assistant. As the Senior Administrative Assistant, Sherri ensures that the daily operations in the office run smoothly. She serves as the primary contact for visitors, guides students to their appropriate career coaches and CCPD resources. Sherri also assists with special projects such as the annual outcomes report for graduating seniors, the Law School Fair, and provides technical and logistical support for multiple meetings, conferences, and workshops. Contact Phone Number 859.238.5283 Email sherri.gowins@centre.edu Contact & Location Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 CCPD Hours M Monday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Jess Metzmeier Meet Jess Joy Asher Meet Joy Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Nate Meissner Meet Nate Lainy Castañeda Meet Lainy Kaitlyn Overstreet Meet Kaitlyn Michael Taylor Meet Michael Laura Hill Meet Laura Genny Ballard Meet Genny Bryana Miracle Meet Bryana Sherri Gowins Meet Sherri Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Centre College"
