    "https://careers.centre.edu/resources/": {
      "title": "Resources",
      "description": "Resources – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team Resources Search all Resources Search Skip filter options to posts Filter Clear Filter: Filters See More Filters Filter Controls Resource Categories: Community Resources Cover Letter/Thank You Resources Employer Resources Faculty & Staff Resources Financial Aid How-tos & Support Guides Job Search Tools Networking Tools Online Tools Professional Associations Resume Resources Student Clubs & Organizations Student Highlighted Resources Build Career Skills: Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find a Job Find an Internship Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Career Exploration Communities: Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Close Clear Filters Academic Credit Internships Share This: Share Academic Credit Internships on Facebook Share Academic Credit Internships on LinkedIn Share Academic Credit Internships on X Copy Link Academic-credit internships require the supervision of a faculty member and an on-site supervisor, combining a substantive academic component with a … Read More Internship Learning Agreements Share This: Share Internship Learning Agreements on Facebook Share Internship Learning Agreements on LinkedIn Share Internship Learning Agreements on X Copy Link Centre College requires that students complete their internship learning agreements online through Docusign. This system allows students to complete contracts … Read More Applying for Grad School Share This: Share Applying for Grad School on Facebook Share Applying for Grad School on LinkedIn Share Applying for Grad School on X Copy Link View Resource Career Advocates Share This: Share Career Advocates on Facebook Share Career Advocates on LinkedIn Share Career Advocates on X Copy Link Put the power of the Centre Alumni network to work. Former students helping current students succeed is the heart of … Read More GRE Test Prep Share This: Share GRE Test Prep on Facebook Share GRE Test Prep on LinkedIn Share GRE Test Prep on X Copy Link Test preparation for the GRE through Educational Testing Services. View Resource Non-Credit Internships Share This: Share Non-Credit Internships on Facebook Share Non-Credit Internships on LinkedIn Share Non-Credit Internships on X Copy Link Non-credit internships are those that do not receive academic credit and are often completed during the summer.  They do not … Read More How to Study for the GRE Share This: Share How to Study for the GRE on Facebook Share How to Study for the GRE on LinkedIn Share How to Study for the GRE on X Copy Link Basic information about the GRE, how it is organized, and links to further resources. View Resource Career Explorations Quiz Share This: Share Career Explorations Quiz on Facebook Share Career Explorations Quiz on LinkedIn Share Career Explorations Quiz on X Copy Link Confused about which CEC a student should join? Take this quiz to find out! View Resource Internship Funding Share This: Share Internship Funding on Facebook Share Internship Funding on LinkedIn Share Internship Funding on X Copy Link Centre College provides competitive financial support for students completing high-caliber unpaid or low-paid domestic or international internships during the CentreTerm … Read More Pages