    "https://careers.centre.edu/videos/elevate-your-career-with-p-i-e/": {
      "title": "Elevate Your Career with P.I.E",
      "description": "Elevate Your Career with P.I.E – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team Elevate Your Career with P.I.E Share This: Share Elevate Your Career with P.I.E on Facebook Share Elevate Your Career with P.I.E on LinkedIn Share Elevate Your Career with P.I.E on X Copy Link Published on April 26, 2024 Your browser doesn't support HTML video. Learn about the P.I.E Theory to enable success in your career—Performance, Image and Exposure—the recipe to amplify your success. This session is led by two Centre alumni, Stacy Jackson ’95, Vice President, Water & Tea at The Coca Cola Company, and Prashant Chakradhar ’19, Manager at EY and by Greg Canzano, CEO and Founder of Rosemary Capital.⁠ Transcript Contact & Location Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 CCPD Hours M Monday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Jess Metzmeier Meet Jess Joy Asher Meet Joy Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Nate Meissner Meet Nate Lainy Castañeda Meet Lainy Kaitlyn Overstreet Meet Kaitlyn Michael Taylor Meet Michael Laura Hill Meet Laura Genny Ballard Meet Genny Bryana Miracle Meet Bryana Sherri Gowins Meet Sherri Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Centre College"
    },
    "https://careers.centre.edu/videos/?shared_category=search-for-a-job": {
      "title": "Videos Archive",
      "description": "Videos – Center for Career & Professional Development | Centre College Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Make an appointment Who We Serve Alumni & Parents Employers Faculty & Staff Students Career Exploration Communities What is a CEC? Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Build Career Skills Apply to Grad School Create a Resume / Cover Letter Explore Your Interests Find an Internship Find a Job Interviewing Network with Centre Alumni Our Outcomes Meet the Team Meet the Staff Meet the Student Team Videos Archive Search all Videos Search Skip filter options to posts Videos Filter Clear Filter: Filters See More Filters Filter Controls Video Categories: Student & Alumni Spotlights Industry Insights Employer Spotlights Career & Professional Development Advice Career Exploration Communities: Arts, Media & Entertainment Business & Finance Health & Medicine Law, Government & Policy Science, Engineering & Tech Social Impact Close Clear Filters The Handshake Student Account Prep Your Phone for Professional Life Handshake 101 Emerging Professionals: Skills for Surviving Corporate America Elevate Your Career with P.I.E Learn about the P.I.E Theory to enable success in your career—Performance, Image and Exposure—the recipe to amplify your success. This … Contact & Location Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 CCPD Hours M Monday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Jess Metzmeier Meet Jess Joy Asher Meet Joy Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Nate Meissner Meet Nate Lainy Castañeda Meet Lainy Kaitlyn Overstreet Meet Kaitlyn Michael Taylor Meet Michael Laura Hill Meet Laura Genny Ballard Meet Genny Bryana Miracle Meet Bryana Sherri Gowins Meet Sherri Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Centre College"
