Share 4 Ways to Support Your Transgender Colleagues, During and After Pride on LinkedIn Share 4 Ways to Support Your Transgender Colleagues, During and After Pride on X Copy Link This year’s Pride Month is a bittersweet one, perfectly captured by the chosen theme: Peace, Love, Revolution. At the time of writing this, the ACLU is tracking more than 490 anti-LGBTQ+ laws on the dockets of nearly all state legislatures,  … Vault Show author info A comprehensive resource for students and job seekers looking for career advice, job postings, company reviews from employees, and rankings of the best companies and industry employers. facebook instagram linkedin twitter Read more » How Can You Tell if An Employer Values Diversity and Inclusion in the Workplace? Share This: Share How Can You Tell if An Employer Values Diversity and Inclusion in the Workplace? on Facebook Share How Can You Tell if An Employer Values Diversity and Inclusion in the Workplace? on LinkedIn Share How Can You Tell if An Employer Values Diversity and Inclusion in the Workplace? on X Copy Link Diversity and inclusion in the workplace can feel like a buzz phrase, but in practice, it’s a way to make all employees feel supported and empowered to succeed at work. Some companies do the bare minimum and post pledges on  … Forage Show author info Showcase your skills. Find your career fit. facebook instagram linkedin tiktok twitter Read more » Sidebar Join or change your CEC Job & Internship Opportunities Social Media Content Creator TOSOT Comfort Interior Design Intern DJ Designs, LLC Assistant Painting Supervisor AHRC NYC See All Jobs Contact & Location Phone 859.238.5283 Email careers@centre.edu Address Old Carnegie, First floor 600 West Walnut Street Danville, KY 40422 CCPD Hours M Monday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Jess Metzmeier Meet Jess Joy Asher Meet Joy Kirk Knott Meet Kirk Nate Meis